+**Create service from a local template directory:**
+
+```bash
+serverless create --template-path ../my-template --path myService
+```
+
 ## Options
-- `--template` or `-t` The name of one of the available templates. **Required if --template-url is not present**.
-- `--template-url` or `-u` The name of one of the available templates. **Required if --template is not present**.
+- `--template` or `-t` The name of one of the available templates. **Required if --template-url and --template-path are not present**.
+- `--template-url` or `-u` A URL to a custom template. **Required if --template and --template-path are not present**.
+- `--template-path` A local directory containing the template files. **Required if --template and --template-url are not present**.
 - `--path` or `-p` The path where the service should be created.
 - `--name` or `-n` the name of the service in `serverless.yml`.
 
